WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.360
So my first collection, that isn't just,

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:08.120
I would not just say an anthology

00:00:08.120 --> 00:00:09.100
of other people's work,

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.860
this is my collection, so it's a full
collection

00:00:11.260 --> 00:00:13.760
of writing, and was based on my mother,

00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:15.660
and you can see her on the front cover,

00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:17.700
and she is a nanny.

00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.740
She used to say, I'm not a nanny, I was a
governess.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:24.480
And she went, I taught these children how
to read and write,

00:00:24.560 --> 00:00:26.060
I didn't just change them but on.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:30.800
And so my mom was she's a journal
everything.
